SUMMARY:TDRR #16 Weekday Morning Ride\, Buena Vista Short (20R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: Wade Walburn\n\nCe
 lebrate the Tour de France and ride our Tour de Red Rose as a tribute to t
 he event. This year you can win prizes just by RSVPing on Meetup and Ridin
 g our Rides!\n\nFull Details on Our TdRR Page: [LBC's Tour de Red Rose Pag
 e](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&mo
 dule_id=326153)\n\nTdRR ride details & start location are on the [TdRR Sch
 edule](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=25714
 8&module_id=340196).\n\nCue & GPX File: [Cue & GPX Files](https://routes.l
 ancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-buena-vista-short-20r/)\n\nTour de Red Rose & 
 LBC Notes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Changes and 
 Weather Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!forum
 /lancasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\nHelmets 
 are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic re
 pair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing a Meetup
  Member does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lanca
 sterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is yo
 ur agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub
 .clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) 
 and [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?
 page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https://la
 ncasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154405
 43/
